{"backlinks":[],"content":"「萃：亨。」萃之為義，聚也。物相遇而後聚，聚則通達，故曰亨。\n\n**所出**：《周易 · 萃》 — https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/周易/萃","slug":"萃亨","sources":[{"chapter":"萃","plugin":"wikisource","title":"周易 · 萃","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/周易/萃","work":"周易"}],"status":"ok","summary":"萃之時，萬物咸亨","tags":["周易","卦辭","萃","部:經","部:經/易類"],"title":"萃亨","created":"2026-04-13T03:14:27.708921+00:00","updated":"2026-04-13T03:14:27.708935+00:00"}